                                                "sense_id": "0eb6f30d-459f-3eab-baeb-69959d6bbe77",
                                                "text": "This remark was newsed abroad; whereupon the loyal authorities of Lerwick immediately had the revolutionary skipper arrested, on a charge of high treason."
